OL,3,AMan held after three Jewish women
OL,4,Areport assaults
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after three
OL,7,FJewish women, one of whom was pushing a
OL,8,Fbaby in a pram, reported being
OL,9,Fassaulted in north-east London.
OL,11,FPolice were called to the Clapton
OL,12,FCommon area of Hackney at about 13:40
OL,13,FBST on Monday after a man had been
OL,14,Fdetained by members of Shomrim, a
OL,15,FJewish neighbourhood watch group.
OL,17,FOfficers arrested a 33-year-old man on
OL,18,Fsuspicion of racially aggravated common
OL,19,Fassault. The women are believed to have
OL,20,Fsuffered minor injuries.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
