OL,3,AMan held after three Jewish women
OL,4,Areport assaults
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Metropolitan Police said it was
OL,7,Ftreating the incident as a suspected
OL,8,Fantisemitic hate crime and had
OL,9,Fincreased patrols in the area.
